WEBVTT

00:00:01.003 --> 00:00:10.203
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:00:11.013 --> 00:00:21.213
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:00:25.793 --> 00:00:30.693
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:00:32.203 --> 00:00:37.163
The sunset makes the vast
ocean a beautiful crimson shade.

00:00:37.273 --> 00:00:39.203
A wonderful freefall.

00:00:39.543 --> 00:00:43.503
I just want the wind
to take me somewhere far away.

00:00:45.243 --> 00:00:48.373
I always cleared
impossible hurdles before...

00:00:48.783 --> 00:00:52.583
...just by concentrating
because I didn't want to lose yet.

00:00:54.253 --> 00:01:00.253
But who's to blame when
it's not the best that I can achieve?

00:01:02.593 --> 00:01:08.933
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:01:09.803 --> 00:01:15.933
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:01:16.143 --> 00:01:21.413
Take the map in your heart,
the one that will not fade...

00:01:21.513 --> 00:01:24.573
...and hold it up to the light.

00:01:35.963 --> 00:01:40.193
Hikaru Shidou,
Umi Ryuuzaki, and Fuu Hououji...

00:01:40.673 --> 00:01:44.293
The three were summoned by Princess
Emeraude to become Magic Knights...

00:01:44.403 --> 00:01:47.033
...and save another
world called Cephiro.

00:01:50.483 --> 00:01:53.413
It was a world of terror,
full of monsters...

00:01:53.513 --> 00:01:55.983
...under the rule
of High Priest Zagato.

00:01:57.253 --> 00:02:00.273
Hikaru and company
decided to save Cephiro...

00:02:00.393 --> 00:02:03.413
...after being taught
by Master Mage Clef.

00:02:05.293 --> 00:02:08.383
Believing in and supporting
each other... After much hardship...

00:02:08.493 --> 00:02:12.453
...the three finally acquired
the legendary ore escudo...

00:02:12.563 --> 00:02:17.403
...and evolving the weapons Presea
sacrificed her life to create for them...

00:02:17.743 --> 00:02:21.103
...they embarked on a new journey
in search of the Rune-God...

00:02:21.213 --> 00:02:24.143
...in order to become Magic Knights.

00:02:34.593 --> 00:02:40.323
However, wherever they went,
fearsome minions sent forth...

00:02:40.433 --> 00:02:44.733
...by High Priest Zagato awaited
them, eager to end their lives.

00:02:46.873 --> 00:02:52.833
Revival of Selece,
the Legendary Rune-God

00:03:20.333 --> 00:03:22.423
I'm glad you came, Capella.

00:03:22.933 --> 00:03:26.033
The Magic Knights will be here soon.

00:03:26.503 --> 00:03:28.473
I'll get them this time.

00:03:29.913 --> 00:03:31.773
You're saying it doesn't concern you?

00:03:31.883 --> 00:03:34.853
Both Pajero and Vigor
were killed by them!

00:03:34.953 --> 00:03:37.043
They were both your friends!

00:03:39.653 --> 00:03:41.283
That's right, Capella.

00:03:41.393 --> 00:03:44.223
You're going to defeat
the Magic Knights with me!

00:03:44.893 --> 00:03:46.153
Like this.

00:04:09.613 --> 00:04:11.053
Wow...

00:04:13.223 --> 00:04:15.283
This is such a lovely view.

00:04:18.293 --> 00:04:19.813
Mokona, do you mean...

00:04:19.923 --> 00:04:22.723
You mean the legendary
Rune-God is down here...

00:04:24.963 --> 00:04:28.093
What? This isn't
that weird Spring of Eterna!

00:04:28.203 --> 00:04:30.963
You can't be
telling us to dive in again!

00:04:41.283 --> 00:04:42.683
What is that?

00:04:44.523 --> 00:04:46.483
You're telling us to get on?

00:04:46.583 --> 00:04:50.253
My, you understand what
Sir Mokona says, Ms. Umi?

00:04:50.363 --> 00:04:50.623
That is so wonderful!

00:04:50.623 --> 00:04:55.533
That is so wonderful!
If it's saying to eat this, even a calm
person like me would get excited.

00:04:58.463 --> 00:05:00.063
I-It's floating!

00:05:11.783 --> 00:05:12.773
What?

00:05:13.713 --> 00:05:14.973
We're gonna crash!

00:05:15.083 --> 00:05:16.713
We're gonna crash!

00:05:28.063 --> 00:05:30.893
We have been
enclosed inside a bubble.

00:05:31.503 --> 00:05:33.693
This is an underwater capsule!

00:05:36.733 --> 00:05:41.003
Mokona! If you can do this
kinda stuff, do it right from the start!

00:05:41.273 --> 00:05:45.903
You knew about this and were
having fun watching us, weren't you?

00:05:47.153 --> 00:05:48.243
Look!

00:06:05.233 --> 00:06:07.633
It looks like... a shrine.

00:06:08.433 --> 00:06:10.133
Umi, what's wrong?

00:06:11.203 --> 00:06:12.643
I don't know.

00:06:15.643 --> 00:06:18.013
My body... feels hot...

00:06:41.333 --> 00:06:43.303
What is this place?

00:06:43.703 --> 00:06:45.693
It seems there is air here.

00:06:47.313 --> 00:06:49.033
This is the Water Shrine.

00:06:49.143 --> 00:06:50.903
The Rune-God is here.

00:06:52.183 --> 00:06:54.413
Umi, how do you know?

00:06:55.353 --> 00:06:57.943
In any case,
we should split up and search.

00:07:09.293 --> 00:07:10.853
There was nothing over there.

00:07:10.963 --> 00:07:13.933
Nothing here either.
I didn't see anything strange.

00:07:14.673 --> 00:07:16.903
Oh? Where is Ms. Umi?

00:07:17.003 --> 00:07:19.093
Umi, where are you?

00:07:19.203 --> 00:07:20.303
Ms. Umi?

00:07:20.403 --> 00:07:21.373
Umi!

00:07:21.673 --> 00:07:22.643
Umi!

00:07:23.573 --> 00:07:25.773
Please answer us!

00:07:26.113 --> 00:07:28.443
Umi!

00:07:41.993 --> 00:07:44.433
This seems to be a very large room.

00:07:45.003 --> 00:07:47.403
Umi, are you in here?

00:07:47.503 --> 00:07:48.473
Umi!

00:08:26.503 --> 00:08:27.873
It is a dragon.

00:08:27.973 --> 00:08:29.373
Umi, watch out!

00:08:31.213 --> 00:08:32.303
Mokona...

00:08:33.183 --> 00:08:35.943
Ms. Hikaru,
Ms. Umi is acting strangely.

00:09:18.623 --> 00:09:20.563
The dragon is coming out.

00:09:20.893 --> 00:09:23.623
Sir Mokona, is Ms. Umi all right?

00:09:38.483 --> 00:09:40.413
My name is Selece.

00:09:41.253 --> 00:09:43.243
I am the legendary Rune-God...

00:09:43.353 --> 00:09:47.283
...that only the legendary
Magic Knight may touch.

00:09:47.853 --> 00:09:49.293
What was that?

00:09:49.393 --> 00:09:50.683
That dragon?

00:09:58.403 --> 00:09:59.423
Umi!

00:09:59.703 --> 00:10:01.763
Umi! Umi!

00:10:02.873 --> 00:10:05.063
No use. It's totally shut.

00:10:05.173 --> 00:10:07.573
That dragon was
the legendary Rune-God?

00:10:10.473 --> 00:10:14.343
Then if we revive that
Rune-God, we can save Cephiro!

00:10:14.883 --> 00:10:17.753
We will be able
to rescue Princess Emeraude!

00:10:23.053 --> 00:10:24.923
I won't allow that.

00:10:27.593 --> 00:10:29.023
Who's there?

00:10:47.613 --> 00:10:51.343
Magic Knights,
how dare you kill my friends.

00:10:52.223 --> 00:10:53.713
Y-You're...

00:10:54.693 --> 00:10:57.683
They were all my good friends!

00:11:12.343 --> 00:11:16.363
Could he be talking about that
sand monster that we defeated?

00:11:16.613 --> 00:11:18.043
I-I get it...

00:11:18.643 --> 00:11:19.703
Vigor!

00:11:19.813 --> 00:11:22.213
Don't listen to them... Listen...

00:11:22.313 --> 00:11:24.373
Listen to me!

00:11:31.293 --> 00:11:33.223
That voice from back then...

00:11:34.963 --> 00:11:36.393
It was you!

00:11:36.493 --> 00:11:39.793
This is for all my friends!
Die, Magic Knights!

00:11:54.083 --> 00:11:56.103
You girls are so weak.

00:11:56.753 --> 00:12:01.123
I wonder what Alcyone
was doing, losing to girls like you.

00:12:02.123 --> 00:12:03.383
Alcyone?

00:12:03.993 --> 00:12:05.823
Then you're friends with her?

00:12:05.923 --> 00:12:06.893
Friends?

00:12:09.463 --> 00:12:12.523
That hag isn't even
close to being my friend.

00:12:12.633 --> 00:12:14.793
My friends are all beasts.

00:12:15.303 --> 00:12:16.363
Beasts?

00:12:21.743 --> 00:12:24.903
Flame Arrow!

00:12:25.183 --> 00:12:26.373
That's weak!

00:12:32.483 --> 00:12:33.583
Ms. Hikaru!

00:12:36.993 --> 00:12:39.423
It's no use... Magic doesn't work...

00:12:45.333 --> 00:12:49.033
Magic Knights,
this will be your grave.

00:12:51.673 --> 00:12:55.633
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:13:00.543 --> 00:13:02.843
The legendary... Rune-God.

00:13:03.883 --> 00:13:08.823
Girl summoned from another
world to become a Magic Knight.

00:13:10.053 --> 00:13:16.323
Show before me proof that thy power
makes thee worthy of donning me.

00:13:18.763 --> 00:13:19.593
Proof?

00:13:20.663 --> 00:13:23.573
Show before me thy powers.

00:13:24.543 --> 00:13:27.533
Show before me
the strength of thine heart...

00:13:27.643 --> 00:13:31.543
...that makes thee worthy of
becoming a legendary Magic Knight.

00:13:32.543 --> 00:13:35.013
Strength of... my heart...

00:13:43.353 --> 00:13:44.413
Stop!

00:13:51.433 --> 00:13:53.493
You can't defeat me.

00:13:57.173 --> 00:13:58.263
That voice...

00:13:58.373 --> 00:13:59.843
Playtime's over.

00:14:00.203 --> 00:14:01.073
Die!

00:14:01.173 --> 00:14:03.643
Ms. Hikaru,
the gem on his forehead!

00:14:23.363 --> 00:14:24.923
Ms. Hikaru, are you hurt?

00:14:25.033 --> 00:14:27.463
I'm fine. But more importantly...

00:14:27.703 --> 00:14:28.933
A child?

00:14:29.033 --> 00:14:32.333
I thought the voice was
too cute to be Mr. Beast's.

00:14:32.903 --> 00:14:34.843
Y-You guys are cruel!

00:14:35.513 --> 00:14:38.103
You're cruel!
Look what you did to my friend!

00:14:38.213 --> 00:14:39.373
Friend?

00:14:39.483 --> 00:14:41.003
This Mr. Beast?

00:14:41.113 --> 00:14:42.083
Yeah!

00:14:42.413 --> 00:14:44.403
This is my friend!

00:14:44.523 --> 00:14:46.453
Pajero and Vigor too!

00:14:46.553 --> 00:14:50.923
But everyone says that weird
creatures like them aren't my friends!

00:14:51.023 --> 00:14:53.683
That we shouldn't be friendly
because they're monsters!

00:14:53.793 --> 00:14:55.923
Nobody really understands them!

00:14:56.363 --> 00:14:58.193
They were all my good friends!

00:14:58.303 --> 00:14:59.853
How dare you...

00:15:00.303 --> 00:15:01.533
You guys...

00:15:06.203 --> 00:15:09.103
How can you make
your friends attack us?

00:15:09.213 --> 00:15:13.913
Are you all right with us
wounding or defeating your friends?

00:15:14.013 --> 00:15:16.213
I-I'm not all right with it.

00:15:16.313 --> 00:15:18.783
Aren't you sad
if your friends get hurt?

00:15:18.883 --> 00:15:22.413
Don't you feel like helping
your friends when they're in danger?

00:15:22.523 --> 00:15:26.293
If you don't hold your
friends dear, what do you hold dear?

00:15:31.133 --> 00:15:32.223
Capella!

00:15:39.073 --> 00:15:40.873
What are you doing, Capella?

00:15:40.973 --> 00:15:42.873
It's me! It's Ascot!

00:16:13.043 --> 00:16:14.973
Hikaru! Fuu!

00:16:15.073 --> 00:16:18.173
Show before me
the strength of thine heart...

00:16:18.283 --> 00:16:22.213
...that makes thee worthy of
becoming a legendary Magic Knight.

00:16:23.013 --> 00:16:26.573
Show before me
the strength of thine heart.

00:16:28.423 --> 00:16:31.053
Umi, hurry and revive the Rune-God!

00:16:31.493 --> 00:16:33.513
Leave this battle to us!

00:16:33.623 --> 00:16:35.823
Hikaru! Fuu! You can't!

00:16:35.933 --> 00:16:37.363
Let them be.

00:16:38.333 --> 00:16:39.133
Why?

00:16:39.503 --> 00:16:43.563
Yon beast is not a monster
that thou canst defeat.

00:16:44.303 --> 00:16:45.463
Flee.

00:16:46.373 --> 00:16:48.133
T-That can't be...

00:16:51.813 --> 00:16:55.843
Thine objective is
to defeat High Priest Zagato.

00:16:56.253 --> 00:16:59.243
For this reason,
thou cannot be killed here.

00:16:59.353 --> 00:17:01.823
Thou must survive,
even if thou art alone.

00:17:01.923 --> 00:17:04.913
That is the strength of thine heart.

00:17:05.723 --> 00:17:07.493
The strength of my heart...

00:17:07.593 --> 00:17:10.753
Show before me thy strength!

00:17:11.463 --> 00:17:14.523
Show before me
the strength of thine heart...

00:17:14.633 --> 00:17:18.363
...that makes thee worthy of
becoming a legendary Magic Knight!

00:17:18.743 --> 00:17:21.433
To run away,
leaving Hikaru and Fuu here...

00:17:21.543 --> 00:17:24.843
That can't be
the strength of my heart!

00:17:29.353 --> 00:17:30.573
I can't...

00:17:31.223 --> 00:17:33.243
I can't do that!

00:17:36.353 --> 00:17:38.123
Water...

00:17:43.033 --> 00:17:44.463
...Dragon!

00:17:49.503 --> 00:17:51.973
How dare you hurt Hikaru and Fuu!

00:17:54.543 --> 00:17:56.273
Winds of Protection!

00:18:01.253 --> 00:18:02.113
Fuu!

00:18:02.213 --> 00:18:05.983
I-It seems that I have
managed to create another spell...

00:18:06.983 --> 00:18:07.953
Fuu!

00:18:11.193 --> 00:18:13.323
Ruby Lightning!

00:18:16.633 --> 00:18:17.653
Hikaru!

00:18:18.463 --> 00:18:19.593
Umi...

00:18:22.203 --> 00:18:24.173
Hikaru, are you all right?

00:18:32.613 --> 00:18:34.583
Umi... together...

00:18:35.813 --> 00:18:37.513
Ms. Umi, I as well...

00:18:38.023 --> 00:18:39.113
Hikaru...

00:18:39.553 --> 00:18:40.483
Fuu...

00:18:42.253 --> 00:18:43.153
I...

00:18:43.953 --> 00:18:45.053
I...

00:18:46.963 --> 00:18:49.433
If it means leaving
Hikaru and Fuu behind...

00:18:50.233 --> 00:18:54.323
...then I don't need a Rune-God!

00:19:19.063 --> 00:19:20.683
A-A robot?

00:19:20.793 --> 00:19:22.383
That dragon...

00:19:22.493 --> 00:19:24.763
The Rune-God is a giant robot?

00:19:57.333 --> 00:19:58.563
The Rune-God...

00:19:58.663 --> 00:20:00.793
...lent us its powers!

00:20:09.043 --> 00:20:10.303
But why?

00:20:10.743 --> 00:20:13.373
I didn't show you
the strength of my heart!

00:20:13.943 --> 00:20:16.073
Legendary Magic Knight.

00:20:16.613 --> 00:20:21.383
I have seen proof of the strength of
thine heart that cares for thy comrades.

00:20:22.153 --> 00:20:24.883
T-Then what you said earlier...

00:20:26.163 --> 00:20:28.853
Thou hast overcome the challenge.

00:20:29.893 --> 00:20:31.093
Challenge?

00:20:31.833 --> 00:20:35.793
It seems that you were being
tested by the Rune-God, Ms. Umi.

00:20:36.233 --> 00:20:39.673
It's because you saved us
instead of running away.

00:20:39.773 --> 00:20:42.363
It accepted you as a Magic Knight!

00:20:42.743 --> 00:20:44.373
No, it's because...

00:20:45.683 --> 00:20:48.303
...we were able to fight together!

00:20:48.713 --> 00:20:54.243
However, thine heart
is not yet ready to don me.

00:20:55.123 --> 00:20:58.143
When thou awakens
as a true Magic Knight...

00:20:58.893 --> 00:21:03.353
...I will show myself
to thee once again.

00:21:26.053 --> 00:21:27.613
T-This is...

00:21:29.193 --> 00:21:31.283
The armor evolved again!

00:21:32.763 --> 00:21:34.493
Umi! Fuu!

00:21:34.593 --> 00:21:37.963
The Rune-God's been revived!
We can save Cephiro now!

00:21:38.703 --> 00:21:42.863
We have now acquired the evolving
weapons and the Rune-God!

00:21:43.773 --> 00:21:47.643
Let's get Zagato! I'll defeat you,
wherever you come from!

00:21:47.743 --> 00:21:49.333
Yeah, that's it, Umi!

00:21:49.413 --> 00:21:51.373
That is so wonderful!

00:22:03.193 --> 00:22:06.123
One of the Rune-Gods
has been revived.

00:22:26.743 --> 00:22:31.153
Put the best smile
you can on your face...

00:22:32.723 --> 00:22:38.313
...and push down on that
pedal as hard as you can.

00:22:39.763 --> 00:22:45.323
Even if a really
strong wind blows against you...

00:22:46.063 --> 00:22:49.903
...don't give up hope so easily.

00:22:52.203 --> 00:22:55.373
Head for the big blue sea
that whispers in your ear...

00:22:55.573 --> 00:22:58.013
...what you really
need to know right now.

00:22:59.113 --> 00:23:02.913
Power that lets you
win over your tears.

00:23:03.953 --> 00:23:10.583
Now do the best that you can!
Your eyes will be someday soon...

00:23:11.323 --> 00:23:16.593
...basking in warm sunlight
and will start to shimmer.

00:23:16.963 --> 00:23:23.763
Just keep believing yourself
and never, ever give up...

00:23:24.273 --> 00:23:29.713
Your faith becomes
courage to live one more day.

00:23:45.993 --> 00:23:48.083
I am Fuu Hououji.

00:23:48.633 --> 00:23:51.893
High Priest Zagato
suddenly appeared before us...

00:23:52.003 --> 00:23:55.953
...and we were trapped in
something resembling a cocoon.

00:23:56.073 --> 00:23:58.693
However, Ferio saved us.

00:23:59.043 --> 00:24:03.403
And Ferio told us something
that complicated the situation.

00:24:04.213 --> 00:24:06.273
Magic Knight Rayearth...

00:24:06.513 --> 00:24:09.243
The Legend of the Rune-God -
In a World Called Cephiro.

00:24:09.353 --> 00:24:11.623
The Legend of the Rune-God-
In a World Called Cephiro
Please be sure to watch it!

00:24:11.623 --> 00:24:13.353
The Legend of the Rune-God-
In a World Called Cephiro

00:24:13.353 --> 00:24:20.283
Who is it today?

00:24:21.163 --> 00:24:23.253
Today, it's Mokona!

00:24:23.363 --> 00:24:29.323
Look forward to the next episode!
